{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43098","headline":"题春梦秋归故里 · 吉师老","name":"题春梦秋归故里","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故国归路赊，春晚在天涯。\n明月夜来梦，碧山秋到家。\n开窗闻落叶，远墅见晴鸦。\n惊起晓庭际，莺啼桃杏花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吉师老","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43098.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43098","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}